          "name": "sixth trial jurors",
          "value": "11",
          "unit": "white jurors",
          "sentence": "During the sixth trial in 2010, Flowers was sentenced to death. There were 11 white jurors and one Black juror who considered the case after District Attorney Doug Evans struck five Black prospective jurors.",
          "occurrence_id": "occurrence-6036db947c0c2244b73eff915f915ec850a612bbec5e4f54cbb4d43421582d1b-ce4d6c33496c31c4"
